"""Build agency profiles for every agency on the OSBM "Agency Strategic Plans" page (Nov 2026).

    python -m agency_profiles.build_statewide        # writes agency_profiles/profiles/<id>.json (skips deq/dncr/dpi)

How these were made (be honest about it in the pitch):
  * Goals and objectives are CLOSE SUMMARIES of each plan's own goals/objectives, read from the PDFs on the OSBM page,
    with the goal/objective number and the plan link as the citation. Check exact wording before quoting externally.
  * Keywords, search terms and usual federal funders were chosen by the team to describe each agency's federal
    funding areas; they are matching aids, not claims from the plan.
  * reviewed_by is empty until an agency contact confirms the profile (pilot step).
The hand-built DEQ, DNCR and DPI profiles are not touched.
"""
